<p class="last-updated"><strong>Last Updated:</strong> September 9, 2026</p>

<div class="legal-notice-banner">
  <h2>Fast & Free Shipping Across USA</h2>
  <p>We offer <strong>100% FREE 7-day shipping to all 50 states</strong>. Your bike will be carefully inspected, securely packaged in heavy-duty reinforced crates, and shipped within 24–48 hours of order confirmation.</p>
</div>

<h2>Processing Time</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Order Processing:</strong> 24 to 48 hours (1–2 business days).</li>
  <li><strong>Order Verification:</strong> Every order is verified to ensure delivery and billing accuracy.</li>
  <li><strong>Quality Check:</strong> Multi-point technical inspection conducted before packaging.</li>
  <li><strong>Weekend Orders:</strong> Orders placed over the weekend ship Monday or Tuesday.</li>
  <li><strong>Holidays:</strong> May experience a 1-day dispatch delay during major national holidays.</li>
</ul>

<h2>Shipping Time & Costs</h2>
<div class="page-grid">
  <div class="page-card">
    <h3>Delivery Time</h3>
    <p><strong>5–7 business days</strong> to all 50 USA states.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="page-card">
    <h3>Cost</h3>
    <p><strong>FREE ($0.00)</strong> on all orders (no minimum order required).</p>
  </div>
  <div class="page-card">
    <h3>Carriers</h3>
    <p>FedEx Freight, FedEx Ground, UPS Freight, or USPS Priority Mail.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<h2>Shipping Destinations</h2>

<h3>✅ We Ship To:</h3>
<ul>
  <li>All 50 United States (including Alaska and Hawaii).</li>
  <li>Residential addresses with truck road accessibility.</li>
  <li>Commercial facilities and business locations.</li>
</ul>

<h3>❌ We Do NOT Ship To:</h3>
<ul>
  <li>International destinations (USA only at this time).</li>
  <li>PO Boxes for bike shipments (federal regulations require physical addresses for lithium-battery vehicles).</li>
  <li>Freight forwarders without prior written verification.</li>
</ul>

<h2>Special Delivery Protocol & Signature Required</h2>
<div class="legal-notice-banner">
  <p><strong>⚠️ Adult Signature Required (18+):</strong> All bike deliveries require an adult aged 18 or older with valid photo identification present to sign for delivery.</p>
</div>
<p>The freight carrier will contact you via phone or SMS prior to delivery to schedule an agreed delivery appointment window. Please inspect the crate exterior before signing the delivery receipt.</p>

<h2>Order Tracking</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Tracking Code:</strong> Sent via email within 24 hours of package handoff.</li>
  <li><strong>Real-Time Updates:</strong> Track your shipment 24/7 on carrier portals:
    <ul>
      <li>FedEx: <a href="https://www.fedex.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">fedex.com</a></li>
      <li>UPS: <a href="https://www.ups.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ups.com</a></li>
      <li>USPS: <a href="https://tools.usps.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">usps.com</a></li>
    </ul>
  </li>
</ul>

<h2>Shipping Insurance</h2>
<p><strong>All orders are automatically 100% insured against loss, theft, and damage during transit.</strong> If an issue arises, Bike Bee handles the claim directly with the carrier and dispatches a replacement or full refund.</p>

<h2>Shipping Delays</h2>
<p>While over 96% of orders arrive within 7 days, occasional delays may happen due to severe weather events, national carrier holiday volumes, or remote rural delivery routes.</p>

<h2>Order Modifications & Cancellations</h2>
<p>Address changes and cancellations are accepted <strong>within 2 hours of order placement</strong>. Once shipped, addresses cannot be modified and standard return policies apply.</p>

